---
import ResearchPage from "../components/ResearchPage.astro";
import LinkButton from "@/components/LinkButton.astro";
---

<ResearchPage lang="en">
  <p class="mb-2">
    As a PhD student and postdoc at Charles University, I worked on research
    projects related to:
  </p>
  <ul class="mb-4 list-disc pl-6">
    <li>generating text from structured data,</li>
    <li>evaluating generated text,</li>
    <li>LLM agents and reasoning,</li>
    <li>training open language models,</li>
    <li>autonomous web navigation.</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="mb-4">
    I am <b>no longer actively involved</b> in research.
  </p>
  <p class="mb-4">
    You can find all my publications on <LinkButton
      icon="tabler:school"
      href="https://scholar.google.cz/citations?user=6NnuRB8AAAAJ&hl=cs"
      >Google Scholar</LinkButton
    > (<i>h-index: 11</i>). Here are some of them:
  </p>
</ResearchPage>
